summary:
  A station the heal road takes for dead while its alarm rings is not reported to the alarm.

history:
  Bench, 2026-11-12: an alarm's station held its connection and sent
  nothing 8 s into the wake-up. The tone's one check, 25 s after
  the fire, had passed on playing=true position=7968, and nothing asked
  again: 188 s of silence with the heal road knocking three times. With the
  server gone 41 s into the alarm it was 155 s.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          alarmEngine.stationFell(Date.now());

replace:
          alarmEngine.rings(Date.now());

expect:
  Killed by test_invariants::test_an_alarm_whose_station_falls_silent_has_its_tone_asked_about_again.
  Line-neutral.
